<% content_for :title, "New project" %>
<h1 class="mb-6 text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">New project</h1>
<div class="max-w-3xl">
  <div class="mb-6 rounded-lg border border-sky-500/30 bg-sky-500/10 p-4 text-sm text-sky-200">
    <p class="font-medium">Prefer deploying from your terminal?</p>
    <div class="mt-1 text-sky-200/80">
      You don't need to add anything here. Run <code class="text-sky-100">kamal setup</code> or <code class="text-sky-100">kamal deploy</code> from your app's folder as usual, pointing at this server,
      and Kamal Web adds the app by itself within 5 minutes, or right away with
      <%= button_to "Scan this server", discovery_path, class: "inline cursor-pointer underline hover:text-sky-100", form_class: "inline" %>.
      Add a project below only if you want to deploy from Kamal Web too.
    </div>
  </div>
  <%= render "form", project: @project %>
</div>
